<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Reliance Insurance 95 profit up.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Reliance Insurance 95 profit up.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on December 31, 1995</p>
<p>(In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1995	   1994</p>
<p>    Gross premium income  221.97  vs   196.91</p>
<p>    Net premium income    134.35  vs   116.81</p>
<p>    Gross claims	    68.18   vs   73.64</p>
<p>    Underwriting profit   24.15   vs   23.42</p>
<p>    Profit before tax     33.17   vs   30.87</p>
<p>    Dividend	     20 percent vs nil</p>
<p>Note: Reliance Insurance Limited held its first annual general meeting on Monday after going public in May last year. It offered its shares at 285 taka including a premioum of 185 taka. The share was traded at 760.46 on Sunday. Friday is weekend in Moslem Bangladesh.</p>
</text>
